cff-version: 1.2.0

message: >-
  If you use CosmoFit in a publication, please cite the software as
  below -- and, more importantly, cite the papers behind whatever you
  actually used. Every dataset, model and statistical method in the
  library is somebody else's work; REFERENCES.md lists all of them
  with links and with where in the code each one is used.

title: "CosmoFit: a modular Python library for cosmological parameter estimation"

type: software

authors:
